msgid "Purpose"
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/capabilities/cap-tables.md
msgid "Tabular data is held in an open, transactional format that more than one engine can read."
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/capabilities/cap-tables.md
msgid "Why"
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/capabilities/cap-tables.md
msgid "Open formats keep the data readable even without the current vendor, and the exit test proves it ([P16]{1}). Holding table history for a set time is what makes a fallback window possible."
msgstr ""

